<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Type Safety on Bang Trinh - Developer</title><link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/en/tags/type-safety/</link><description>Recent content in Type Safety on Bang Trinh - Developer</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 16:20:00 +0700</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/en/tags/type-safety/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Java Generics Explained</title><link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/en/blogs/java-generics-explained/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 16:20:00 +0700</pubDate><guid>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/en/blogs/java-generics-explained/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Generics make Java code type-safe and easier to maintain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="why-use-generics"&gt;Why Use Generics?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-java" data-lang="java"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;List&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;String&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; names &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; ArrayList&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;();
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;names.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;add&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Alice&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// names.add(10); // Lỗi biên dịch!&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="tip"&gt;Tip&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use &lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt; for classes or methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helps avoid manual casting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;N.B.&lt;/strong&gt; Generics improve type-safety but cannot be used directly with primitive types.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>